Expected (checked source): 1958: semi unsupported, conservative refuted/unsupported, dispersive unsupported.
Source: Meselson & Stahl 1958 (PMID 16590258): the generation-1 hybrid band rules out conservative only; generation 2 is needed to rule out dispersive. -/
-- current core in 1958: A1 [support-both] semi contested; conservative refuted; dispersive contested; A2 [A2:0] semi unsupported; conservative unsupported; dispersive unsupported
/-- B2 on the frame as first written (no extra curation). -/
